      "title": "Ashes of the Sigil, the Terminus of Oblivion",
      "premise": "After the death of the gods, the world's memories were sealed within the 'Underground Library,' and their records were slowly fading into nothingness. Seeking fragments of lost myths, a young archivist named Ern boards the forbidden 'Final Train.' This train does not run to bring about the end of the world, but to bury the glorious eras of the past forever. Through this journey, Ern begins to discover a forbidden spell etched into his very bloodline—one capable of rewriting the laws of reality itself."
